# Day 20 – Automation Workflow Prompts

## What is an Automation Workflow Prompt?

Automation Workflow Prompts help AI design a step-by-step process that automates a task or business workflow.

## Why is it useful?

A small business receives 100 customer emails every day.

Instead of replying one by one:

Workflow:

Read the email.
Identify the topic.
Categorize it.
Draft a reply.
Flag unusual cases for a human.

This saves time and keeps work organized.
#mistake - It is useful because it saves time, reduces repetitive work, improves accuracy, and keeps business processes organized.

## Name 5 Automation Tasks

- Customer Support
- Email Replies
