- Report Generation

## My Own Automation Workflow Prompt

Write one automation workflow prompt for a business.

You are an AI automation consultant.

Design an automation workflow for an online clothing store.

The workflow should:

Receive customer inquiries.
Categorize each inquiry.
Draft a suitable response.
Flag complex questions for a human.
Organize customer information.

Present the workflow as a numbered list.

Review the workflow before giving the final version.

